<title>USA: Dillard March same-store sales up 1 pct.</title>
<headline>Dillard March same-store sales up 1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillard Department</p>
<p>Stoes Inc Thursday reported sales for the 36 and 64 day</p>
<p>periods ended April 6.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $641.1     $610.1	  +5	   +1</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,102.1   $1,042.3	  +6	   +1</p>
<p>The company said it is reporting March sales on a 36 day basis to preserve comparability due to the shift in the Easter Holiday.   ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
